OL,3,GNEWSAPart of M40 southbound shut after
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the southbound carriageway of
OL,7,Fthe M40 has been shut due to a crash,
OL,8,FNational Highways said.
OL,10,FThe road has been closed between
OL,11,Fjunction 1A near Gerrards Cross,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, and junction one for
OL,13,Fthe M25 link road.
OL,15,FThames Valley Police said it was called
OL,16,Fto a crash, reported to National
OL,17,FHighways at 05:45 GMT, in which people
OL,18,Fsustained minor injuries.
OL,20,FThere are delays of 90 minutes and four
OL,21,Fmiles of congestion on the approach,
OL,22,Fthe roads agency said.
